       $$
       0.4 \times 5 = \$2
       $$
     - Total discounted cost:
       $$
       8 \text{ glasses} \times \$2 = \$16
       $$

4. **Total Cost**:
   $$
   \$40 (\text{regular}) + \$16 (\text{discounted}) = \boxed{56}
   $$

