I don't think there's any trick here. The problem is straightforward, just making sure to convert eggs to dozens at the end. Maybe someone could make a mistake in the multiplication steps, but I think 3*28 is definitely 84. And 84 divided by 12 is 7. So, the answer is 7 dozens.
